{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231040","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423104001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9923F58E8C6C41C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","variant_male_record_index":"168651","variant_female_record_index":"168652","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1423104001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你来啦，瞧我，都腾不开手招待你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9923F58E8C6C41C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나? 봐봐. 손님 맞이할 틈도 없네.","variant_male_record_index":"168651","variant_female_record_index":"168652","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423104002:1":{"text":"윽... 그게, 엉망이야!","source_cn":"唉……简直是，一团乱麻！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9796B339DDAACDA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423104003:1":{"text":"헬라가 생산 라인 쪽을 확인해 봤는데, 대부분의 장인이 일손을 놓아버렸더라. 그나마 헬라 말을 듣는 몇명이 어떻게든 돌리고 있긴 한데, 그걸로는 라인 전체를 운영하기엔 택도 없었어.","source_cn":"生产线那边，海拉告诉我，大多数工匠都在怠工，少数听她话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F3109C61A84014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423104004:1":{"text":"게다가 숙련된 장인들은 아이언비어드의 말만 들어서, 아이언비어드가 원하는 대로 마을을 떠날 생각인가봐.","source_cn":"还有一批资历深的工匠现在只听铁须的话，他们都是技术上的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC17754332A326E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423104005:1":{"text":"이 상태로 가다간 우리 같은 고집쟁이들 말고 마을의 장인들이 전부 떠나버릴 거야...","source_cn":"照这样下去，除了我们这些老顽固，村里的工匠很快就要走空了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBB9583B086578D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423104006:0":{"text":"모아 강철 연구나 셀로클랜드와의 협력은 애초에 말할 단계도 아니었어!","source_cn":"更别提研究魔钢和跟萨洛克兰合作这种事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC289ACE59F30D238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1423104006":{"text":"모아 강철 연구나 셀로클랜드와의 협력은 애초에 말할 단계도 아니었어!","source_cn":"更别提研究魔钢和跟萨洛克兰合作这种事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC289ACE59F30D238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423104007:0":{"text":"광산 쪽에서 태업하는 게 가장 큰 문제야. 헬라가 푸른빛 광산 입구에서 질서를 잡으려고 하고 있긴 한데...","source_cn":"矿洞那边怠工的情况是最严重的，海拉正在那边维持秩序……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC6758557B4162B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1423104007":{"text":"광산 쪽에서 태업하는 게 가장 큰 문제야. 헬라가 푸른빛 광산 입구에서 질서를 잡으려고 하고 있긴 한데...","source_cn":"矿洞那边怠工的情况是最严重的，海拉正在那边维持秩序……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC6758557B4162B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423104008:0":{"text":"그럼 너무 고맙지!","source_cn":"那就再好不过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78DA4C26770F81C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"나도 도와줄게","source_cn":"我也去搭把手","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1B208DF773B856E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도 도와줄게","female":"나도 도와줄게","variant_male_record_index":"73644","variant_female_record_index":"73645","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"내가 도울 수 있는 일은 없을까?","source_cn":"有什么我能帮上忙的吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x873E662270BDB5D4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 도울 수 있는 일은 없을까?","female":"내가 도울 수 있는 일은 없을까?","variant_male_record_index":"73642","variant_female_record_index":"73643","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"마을 상황은 어때?","source_cn":"村里的情况怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC645562A639E119B","variant_status":"runtime_g